            "english_quote": "The compressed word order permits some attachment uncertainty, which “the latter” preserves without supplying a name.",
            "issue": "The main rendering is defensible, but “the latter” selects the world-creator as the referent of τούτου; it does not preserve the acknowledged referent uncertainty. The note neither states a material alternative explicitly nor explains why the creator-reference was chosen. Grammatically, τούτου could instead refer to the world mentioned in τὸν κόσμον.",
